  "question": {
    "text": "If for a matrix $A,|A|=6$ and adj $A=\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc}1 & -2, & 4 \\\\ 4 & 1 & 1 \\\\ -1 & k & 0\\end{array}\\right]$, then $k$ is equal to",
