  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "$\\begin{aligned} & \\text {  } A \\cdot(\\operatorname{adj} A)=|A| I \\\\ & \\Rightarrow|A||\\operatorname{adj} A|=|A|^3 \\Rightarrow|\\operatorname{adj} A|=|A|^2 \\\\ & -1((-2-4)-K(1-16)=36 \\Rightarrow 6-K+16 K=36 \\\\ & \\Rightarrow 15 K=30 \\Rightarrow K=2\\end{aligned}$",
